---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Button from './Button.astro';
import Nav from './Nav.astro';
import heroImage from '../assets/hero.jpg';
---

<section class="hero">
	<Image
		class="hero-bg"
		src={heroImage}
		alt=""
		width={2560}
		height={1707}
		widths={[960, 1440, 1920, 2560]}
		sizes="100vw"
		loading="eager"
		fetchpriority="high"
	/>

	<div class="hero-inner">
		<Nav />

		<div class="hero-content">
			<p data-reveal>
				Present Joy is a walk of hope that does not ask for more than we can give, yet gives more
				than we dared ask. It is a pilgrimage that lasts a lifetime for those who seek recovery, not
				a cure; progress, not perfection. It is a journey that rejoices on the other side of the
				burdens we carry and pains we try to hide. Present Joy is the recovery that guides us all our
				days and the conviction that keeps us every step of the way.
			</p>

			<Button href="/about" data-reveal>Learn More</Button>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	/* Renders outside <main>, so it already spans the full viewport width.
	   Avoids 100vw, which would overflow by the scrollbar width. */
	.hero {
		position: relative;
		min-height: 100svh;
		overflow: hidden;
		isolation: isolate;
	}

	/* Full-bleed photo behind everything in the hero. */
	.hero :global(.hero-bg) {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: -2;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 55%;
	}

	/* Softens the photo so the blue logo and copy stay legible over the sky. */
	.hero::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: -1;
		background: linear-gradient(
			to bottom,
			rgb(255 255 255 / 0.55) 0%,
			rgb(255 255 255 / 0.4) 45%,
			rgb(255 255 255 / 0) 85%
		);
	}

	.hero-inner {
		display: flex;
		min-height: 100svh;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.hero-content {
		display: grid;
		flex: 1;
		align-content: center;
		justify-items: center;
		gap: 2.75rem;
		/* Extra bottom padding pulls the centred copy up, scaled to viewport
		   height so it rises on tall screens without crowding short ones. */
		padding: 1rem 1.5rem clamp(5rem, 24svh, 20rem);
	}

	.hero-content p {
		max-width: 46ch;
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--brand-blue);
		font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 0.9rem + 0.7vw, 1.5rem);
		line-height: 1.75;
		text-align: center;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}
</style>
